from 3Blue1Brown about sequences that&nbsp;
don't necessarily do what you'd expect.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.020
Links to the first two videos are on the screen&nbsp;
and in the video description; you don't have to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:20.400
have watched them to understand this one but you&nbsp;
