who seems to be in the lead. And you know they're&nbsp;
pretty close, they're a pretty even balanced like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:52.260
you might expect; but if it was completely&nbsp;
random, if it was just random which bucket&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:56.880
you're tossing it into you wouldn't expect such a&nbsp;
long streak for there to be a particular winner.

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:17.880
And in fact it continues going on until the&nbsp;
first time that team 1 mod 4 is gonna break into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:27.540
the lead is going to happen at the prime 26,861.&nbsp;
But even then the next prime after that is going&nbsp;

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:36.120
to be 26,863. So that was just one brief moment&nbsp;
of peeking into the lead and then after that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:41.040
do stay in the lead quite a bit longer, team&nbsp;
3 mod 4. And then the next time that team 1 is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:48.240
able to get ahead is going to happen at 616,841.&nbsp;
And it keeps the lead a little bit longer then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:53.340
but then 3 takes over. And if you're looking at&nbsp;
